sentences.text:
Accordingly, I pass the following:
ORDER i) The petition is allowed;
ii) The impugned proceedings in C.C.No.2438/2024 (arising out of Crime No.53/2024 of Mangalore Women's Police Station), pending on the file of JMFC, III Court, D.K., Mangalore, for the offences NC: 2025:KHC:15364 punishable under Sections 498A, 323, 341, 506 read with 34 of IPC are hereby quashed.

